# The contact form posts to Resend. Without RESEND_API_KEY the form still
# renders and still shows the email address, but every submit returns an
# error — so set this before the form is any use.
#
# Local:   copy this file to .env.local and paste the key in. .env* is
#          gitignored, so it cannot be committed by accident.
# Railway: Project -> Variables. Railway redeploys on a variable change,
#          so nothing else to do.

RESEND_API_KEY=
# Optional. Resend only lets you send from a domain you have verified with
# them. Until jordangrieve.com is verified, leave this unset and it falls
# back to onboarding@resend.dev, which can only deliver to the address that
# owns the Resend account — which is where this form sends anyway.
#
# Once the domain is verified:
# CONTACT_FROM="Portfolio <hello@jordangrieve.com>"
CONTACT_FROM=
